description:
Complete deterministic ancestry traits, structured background grants, and
equipment/material semantics.

Required membership — all of:
- Breath Weapon, Lucky, Relentless Endurance, Savage Attacks, Trance, Infernal
  Legacy, darkvision / sleep immunity, Dwarven Toughness, Tinker, and all
  remaining ancestry omissions;
- structured background equipment, including embedded choices and currency;
- wooden-shield / material constraints;
- Potion of Healing use (currently prose-only);
- open language-choice escape hatch (shared with C1);
- typed weapon, armor, skill, save, and tool proficiency grants.

Closes findings: SOL-004, SOL-010, SOL-011, SOL-012, F-13, F-18, CAP-005,
CAP-006, CAP-012, CAP-013.
